Package: zebRabox
Type: Package
Title: Processing and Visualization of ZebraBox Behavioural Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Antoine", "Tourret", email = "antoinetourretpro@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: Antoine Tourret <antoinetourretpro@gmail.com>
Description: Turns raw exports of the ViewPoint ZebraBox high-throughput
    behavioural chamber into clean, merged, analysis-ready datasets and
    figures. Provides randomized plate plan generation, import of tracking
    and quantization data recorded under light/dark or vibration/rest
    protocols, period assignment and data removal steps, period, cumulative,
    delta and time-course visualizations, percentage tables and statistical
    tests. All steps are available both through a Shiny application and as
    standalone R functions for reproducible scripted workflows.
